description:
Design a circuit that compares two 8-bit inputs and outputs a signal indicating whether they match. The `match` output will be HIGH (1) if all corresponding bits of `in1` and `in2` are equal; otherwise, it will be LOW (0). The module utilizes a loop to evaluate the individual bits of the inputs and employs a bitwise AND operation to determine equality across all bits.
