description:
Design a circuit that converts a 4-bit Binary-Coded Decimal (BCD) input into an 8-bit binary output. The module calculates the equivalent decimal value from the BCD input and then shifts the binary representation according to the significant digits, effectively converting the decimal value into an appropriate 8-bit binary format for output.
